		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Postgresql : socket Unix « /var/run/postgresql/.s.PGSQL.5432 » ?]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=29458#p29458"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>pg_lsclusters<br />Ver Cluster Port Status Owner&#160; &#160; Data directory&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Log file<br />10&#160; main&#160; &#160; 5432 down&#160; &#160;postgres /var/lib/postgresql/10/main /var/log/postgresql/postgresql-10-main.log<br />11&#160; main&#160; &#160; 5433 online postgres /var/lib/postgresql/11/main /var/log/postgresql/postgresql-11-main.log</p>]]></content>
